### JSON-RPC Initialize via Unified Endpoint
POST http://localhost:5000/mcp/unified
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "DotNetMCPClient",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "capabilities": {
      "roots": { "listChanged": true },
      "sampling": {}
    }
  }
}

### JSON-RPC Tool Invocation via Unified Endpoint
POST http://localhost:5000/mcp/unified
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "check_api_status",
  "params": {
    "sessionId": "{{SESSION_ID}}",
    "name": "check_api_status",
    "input": {
      "url": "https://example.com/health"
    }
  }
}
